ModalDF.apiDocs:
# ModalDF API

## ModalDFProps

```typescript
type ModalDFProps = {
  fullScreen?:
    | {
        defaultEnabled?: boolean;
        saveStateAfterClosing?: boolean;
        onFullScreen?: () => void;
        onExitFullScreen?: () => void;
      }
    | undefined
    | boolean;
  contentContainerProps?: Partial<ContainerProps>;
  zIndexOverlay?: string;
} & Omit<ModalCompProps, 'hasBody'>;
```

## Compound types

### ModalDF.Header

```typescript
type ModalDFHeaderProps = Omit<BoxProps, 'children'> & {
  title?: ReactNode;
  badge?: ComponentProps<typeof Badge>;
  subTitle?: ReactNode;
  rightBlock?: ReactNode;
  onBackClick?: () => void;
  showBackButton?: boolean;
};
```

### ModalDF.Footer

```typescript
type ModalDFFooterProps = Omit<BoxProps, 'children'> & {
  leftBlock?: ReactNode;
  rightBlock?: ReactNode;
};
```

### ModalDF.ServiceButtons

```typescript
type ModalDFServiceButtonsProps = ComponentProps<
  typeof StyledServiceButtons
>;
```

### ModalDF.DotsIconButton

```typescript
type ModalDFDotsIconButtonProps = ComponentProps<typeof IconButton> & {
  dropdownProps?: ComponentProps<typeof Dropdown>;
  iconSize?: ComponentProps<typeof IconDotsVerticalCenteredOutline>['size'];
};
```

### ModalDF.BackIconButton

```typescript
type ModalDFBackIconButtonProps = ComponentProps<typeof IconButton> & {
  iconSize?: ComponentProps<typeof IconArrowLeft>['size'];
};
```

### ModalDF.Left, ModalDF.Main, ModalDF.Content, ModalDF.Divider

Контейнеры наследуют `BoxProps` и принимают `$css` для локальных правок.

