# Canvas.Text API

## CanvasTextOptions

```typescript
interface CanvasTextOptions {
  font?: string;
  fontSize?: number;
  lineHeightPx?: number;
  color?: string;
  wordWrap?: boolean;
  lineHeight?: number;
